    "turn_text": "great that we have that in common. I just want to say to our Black Let Me podcast listeners. I know that there's some things that the senator wants to talk about, but I've got three main agendas and a bunch of questions. One is I want to get black people to the polls. That's my first agenda. I want to get them to the polls. Secondly, I want to get them to the poll because we need a new president. We need a president. And so that's my second agenda. The third agenda is that I really want to nudge and push the Democratic Party to remember or to just understand the feelings, the sentiments of many African Americans across the class spectrum are feeling very disillusioned and unmotivated. And I'm wanting to help voice that and not just talk about that around the water coolers, but I want to share that with someone who can take it someplace and do something with it. The",
