    "turn_idx": 83,
    "turn_text": "Because, yeah, that's not enough and it has to go with action. We have to keep on saying, okay, we're going to have a measurement or this is the baseline, but let's look at it again and let's look at it again and let's look at it again. I'll go back to the pandemic. It was because one county in Wisconsin was keeping track of coronavirus cases and deaths by race that we kind of open that whole discussion. We have to understand the problem and its proportions at the same time as we're working on solutions.",
