    "turn_text": "Yes. And I would just offer up again, Senator, if you or your office or one of your colleagues in the party could facilitate the discussion that I suggest between business and particularly the minority communities. And because COVID and George Floyd, all of these things are pointing to the inequities that African Americans have been fighting and fighting for for 400 years, any effort that we could get from your office to to provide that kind of discussion because that's where jobs are created, that's for money, could be leveraged because some of the dollars that we need in our community to build infrastructure in grassroots organizations and start small businesses. can come from government. There are loans and there's SBA programs.",
